**Financial Overview & Narrative:**
Summit Software remains in a strong financial position, demonstrating both robust top-line performance and disciplined capital management. Last quarter, we generated **$1.8M in revenue** while maintaining a highly efficient net burn rate of just **$45K per month**. 

